{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-46-1","title":"Psalms 46:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The confidence which the church has in God. 8 An exhortation to behold it.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3108. B.C. 896. (Title.) for. or, of. the sons. 84:1; 85:1; 87:1; *titles A song. 48:1; 66:1; *titles Alamoth. 1Ch 15:20 refuge. 7,11; 62:7,8; 91:1-9; 142:5; Pr 14:26; 18:10; Lu 13:34; Heb 6:18 a very. 145:18; Ge 22:14; De 4:7; 2Sa 22:17-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-2","title":"Psalms 46:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>will. 23:4; 27:3; Mt 8:24-26; Heb 13:6 though. Ge 7:11,12; Lu 21:9-11,25-28,33; 2Pe 3:10-14 mountains. Mt 21:21 midst of the sea. Heb. heart of the seas.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-3","title":"Psalms 46:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the waters. 18:4; 93:3,4; Job 38:11; Isa 5:3; 17:12,13; Jer 5:22; Mt 7:25 Re 17:15 mountains. 114:4-7; Jud 5:4,5; 1Ki 19:11; Job 9:5,6; Jer 4:24; Mic 1:4; Na 1:5 Re 16:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-4","title":"Psalms 46:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>a river. 23:2; 36:8,9; Isa 8:6,7; 48:18; Eze 47:1-12; Re 22:1-3 city. 48:1,8; 87:3; 2Ch 6:6; Isa 37:35,36; 60:14; Heb 12:22; Re 21:2,3,10 holy. De 12:11,12 most. 91:1; 92:1,8; Ec 5:8; Mic 6:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-5","title":"Psalms 46:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>God is. 68:18; De 23:14; Isa 12:6; Eze 43:7,9; Ho 11:9; Joe 2:27; Zep 3:15 Zec 2:5,10,11; 8:3; Mt 18:20; Re 2:1 she. 62:2,6; 112:6; 125:1 and that, etc. Heb. when the mourning appeareth. 30:5; 143:8; Ex 14:24,27; Lu 18:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-6","title":"Psalms 46:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>heathen. 2:1-4; 83:2-8; 2Ch 14:9-13; 20:1,20-24; Isa 8:9,10; 37:21-36 kingdoms. Isa 14:12-16 earth. 68:8; 97:5; Jos 2:9,11,24; Isa 64:1,2; Am 9:5,13; Na 1:5 Hab 3:5,6,10,11; 2Pe 3:10-12; Re 6:13,14; 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-7","title":"Psalms 46:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Lord. 11; Nu 14:9; 2Ch 13:12; Isa 8:10; Mt 28:20; Ro 8:31; 2Ti 4:22 our refuge. Heb. an high place for us. 9:9; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-8","title":"Psalms 46:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Come. 66:5; 92:4-6; 111:2,3; Nu 23:23 desolations. Ex 10:7; 12:30; 14:30,31; Jos 11:20; 2Ch 20:23,24; Isa 24:1 Isa 34:2-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-9","title":"Psalms 46:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>maketh. Isa 2:4; 11:9; 60:18; Mic 4:3,4 breaketh. 76:3-6; Eze 39:3,9,10 burneth. Jos 11:6,9; Mic 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-10","title":"Psalms 46:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Be still. Hab 2:20; Zec 2:13 know. 83:18; 100:3; Ex 18:11; 1Sa 17:46; 1Ki 18:36; 2Ki 19:12 I will be. 21:13; 57:5; 1Ch 29:11; Isa 2:11,17; 5:16; Eze 38:23; Re 15:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-46-11","title":"Psalms 46:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":46,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":46,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the God. 1,7; 48:3; De 33:27; Jer 16:19</p>"}]}